---
name: note_register
description: What changes when the session is a clinician's note.
---
This session is a note. The person writing is the clinician, talking about the case rather than about their own family, and the client is not present. Record what you are told about the case the same way you do in any other session. The examples in these instructions speak to the person as "you" ("your father died", "your family"); here they speak of the person the diagram is about by name, never "you" or "your" for that person.
